-- Full Spectrum: ice cream manufacturers + Chicago distributors (source: pasted gap analysis, Nov 1 2026; contacts not yet re-checked on company sites).
-- SCALE CORRECTION: the pasted note assumed 300 servings per event. Real need = 20 per Tuesday + 30 per Wednesday = 50 per week (or equivalent). Pilot ask = 50 servings/week, not 300.
-- Strategy: approach distributors first (they carry the brands and can do small drops), then manufacturers. Nobody has been contacted. Idempotent.
-- Apply: supabase db query --linked -f supabase/fs-grants-icecream-makers-2026-11-01.sql
