('GlacierPoint (Great Lakes division)','Distributor: nonprofit pricing or donated novelties, small-drop delivery','relationship',null::date,null::date,'in-kind or discounted; need 50 servings/week',false,null,'RANK 1 (distributor). 7451 W 100th Place, Bridgeview IL 60455; use their Great Lakes page and corporate contact form. Carries Nestle/Haagen-Dazs, Ben & Jerry''s, Edy''s, Prairie Farms; bulk, novelties, pints. No published manager phone or giving program. Ask who runs Great Lakes sales; can they do a small weekly drop (about 50 servings: 20 Tue + 30 Wed) or donated/discounted case-lots, plus a loaner freezer? Pasted contacts unverified.','2026-11-01'::date,'corporate','wednesdays',1,'Unknown',null,'to_research','{}'::text[],'Submit contact form / call; ask for Great Lakes sales manager; pitch 50 servings/week pilot','2027-01-15'::date),
